// Expression Pratt path — precedence without outer parens.
// 2 ADD 3 MULTIPLY 4 = 2+(3*4) = 14

SPEAK "pratt start"

MY NAME IS a AS NUMBER SET TO 2 ADD 3 MULTIPLY 4
MY NAME IS b AS NUMBER SET TO (2 ADD 3) MULTIPLY 4
MY NAME IS c AS FLAG SET TO 5 IS GREATER THAN 3
MY NAME IS d AS TEXT SET TO "Ada" AND " · " AND "Lovelace"

SPEAK "a=" AND a
SPEAK "b=" AND b
SPEAK "d=" AND d

MAKE SURE a EQUALS 14
MAKE SURE b EQUALS 20
MAKE SURE c EQUALS TRUE
MAKE SURE d EQUALS "Ada · Lovelace"

SPEAK "expr_pratt_ok=1"
